        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/general-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Panel, made of three pieces, each full loom width, sewn together. Brick red on natural ground. Design shows regular vertical repeat of a flowering fruit-bearing branch running diagonally lower left to upper right. On the central axis, a peacock perches on a  subsidiary branch in each repeat. Cotton of lower two pieces has browned. Four very small holes. Few brown stains."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/3590398f-5f21-3d29-ba98-e926ec67b3ff> .

